# Promising Stairs: "At the beginning of your upkeep, surveil 1." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus for {2}{U}) and, with one
# name among its unlocked doors, never wins (a count of "one or more" would). At turn 3's upkeep the top card, Lightning Bolt, is put into
# the graveyard (surveil, CR 701.46a), so the draw step takes the card under it, Island; at turn 5's upkeep the top card is kept.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Central Elevator // Promising Stairs
Island x5
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x26

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Central Elevator // Promising Stairs.Cast(Ability: Promising Stairs)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
? Result = InProgress
[T3 Bot1.Draw]
? Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Island | )
[T5 Bot1.Draw]
[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
